      "updated": 1788008443321,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Now we are at the index r and there is a subarray starting from some l ending at r index\nwith sum = 0\n\nP(r) = P(l-1) + S(l-r)\n\nso if S(l-r) = 0 then P(r) = P(l-1) \nthis is what we have to find",
      "fontSize": 61,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Now we are at the index r and there is a subarray starting from some l ending at r index\nwith sum = 0\n\nP(r) = P(l-1) + S(l-r)\n\nso if S(l-r) = 0 then P(r) = P(l-1) \nthis is what we have to find",
